---
id: repo.maintain-work-items
title: Maintain Work Items
category: governance
stage: [analyze, discover, inspect, plan, execute, validate, report]
purpose: Normalize, reconcile, and prioritize backlog, roadmap, or work-contract records without losing intent or provenance.
inputs: [work_item_sources, governing_schema]
outputs: [normalized_work_items, reconciliation_report]
mutates_repository: true
